# ---- 行尾统一 ----
# 仓库内存 LF，检出到任何平台也是 LF。
# 不加这个文件时，Windows 上 core.autocrlf=true 会让每次 git add 都警告
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF"，且 macOS/Linux 协作者会看到全文件 diff。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须 CRLF，显式例外（本仓库目前没有，先立规矩免得以后踩）
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf

# ---- 二进制 ----
# 不做行尾转换，也不参与文本 diff / merge
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.webp  binary
*.avif  binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.eot   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.webm  binary
*.pdf   binary
